// ── C. Contributions to Science ──────────────────────────────────────────────
#v(0.8em)
#text(weight: "bold")[C. Contributions to Science]

#v(0.4em)
*1. Undergraduate Research*

During my undergraduate studies in Electrical and Electronic Engineering at the University of Dhaka, I gradually developed a strong interest in machine learning and its real-world applications. I worked under the supervision of Dr. Md Atiqur Rahman Ahad, where I contributed to research on human activity recognition and participated in international competitions, gaining hands-on experience in data preprocessing, feature extraction, and model development. I also collaborated with Dr. Muhammad E. H. Chowdhury on a senior-year project involving physiological signal analysis, where we used deep learning models to transform wrist photoplethysmogram signals into finger photoplethysmogram signals for wearable health monitoring. These research experiences strengthened my technical skills and sparked my long-term interest in applying artificial intelligence to healthcare and biomedical problems.

#v(0.3em)
#set enum(numbering: "1.", indent: 1em)
